      "devanagari": "नाना विधैः तीर रुहैर् वृताम् पुष्प फल द्रुमैः |\nराजन्तीम् राज राजस्य नलिनीम् इव सर्वतः",
      "iast": "nānā vidhaiḥ tīra ruhair vṛtām puṣpa phala drumaiḥ |\nrājantīm rāja rājasya nalinīm iva sarvataḥ",
      "translation": "\"Behold this river, hedged on all sides with various kinds of flowers and fruits, growing on its banks and enhance its loveliness like the lake (Sangadhika) of Kubera (the ruler of Yakshas)\"",
