      "devanagari": "कच्चिन् मणि निकाश उदाम् कच्चित् पुलिन शालिनीम् |\nकच्चित् सिद्ध जन आकीर्णाम् पश्य मन्दाकिनीम् नदीम्",
      "iast": "kaccin maṇi nikāśa udām kaccit pulina śālinīm |\nkaccit siddha jana ākīrṇām paśya mandākinīm nadīm",
      "translation": "\"See this River Mandakini with its crystal-like clear water at some places, with its shining sand-dunes at some places and crowded with Siddhas who are bathing at some other places.\"",
      "notes": [
        "Siddha: A class of semi-divine beings endowed with mystic powers."
