    {
      "id": "2.95.13",
      "label": "2.95.13",
      "numbers": [
        13
      ],
      "devanagari": "विधूत कलुषैः सिद्धैः तपो दम शम अन्वितैः |\nनित्य विक्षोभित जलाम् विहाहस्व मया सह",
      "iast": "vidhūta kaluṣaiḥ siddhaiḥ tapo dama śama anvitaiḥ |\nnitya vikṣobhita jalām vihāhasva mayā saha",
      "translation": "Here are Siddhas (semi-divine beings endowed with mystic powers), free from impurities and rich in asceticism, with their senses and mind under control, who perpetually stir the waters. You too should take a dip in the river along with me.\"",
